{{-- Shown on a sample document: made-up details, nothing saved. The bar is for the screen; the faint SAMPLE mark also prints so a printed sample can never pass for a real one. --}}
<style>
    .sample-banner { max-width: 760px; margin: 12px auto 0; padding: 10px 14px; border: 1px dashed #666; background: #f1f2f4; color: #222; font: 13px/1.4 system-ui, sans-serif; border-radius: 6px; }
    .sample-mark { position: fixed; inset: 0; display: grid; place-items: center; pointer-events: none; z-index: 5; font: 800 110px/1 system-ui, sans-serif; letter-spacing: .1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, .07); transform: rotate(-24deg); }
    @media print { .sample-banner { display: none; } }
</style>
<div class="sample-banner" role="note"><strong>Sample.</strong> These are made-up details, so you can see how this document looks before you have any loans. It uses your saved Receipt settings. Nothing here is a real loan.</div>
